# toolcheck.skip: the programs under tools/ and examples/ that toolcheck
# does not hold to a clean check, one per line, each with its reason.  A
# line names a path or a folder (ending in /).  An entry whose path no
# longer exists fails the gate, so the list cannot rot.
tools/ownfuzz/golden/        ownfuzz's golden cases: refused by design, held by ownfuzz.sh
tools/review/Shapes.m9       the review's fall-off fixture: its Bad* functions must be refused
tools/skillsbench/tasks/     the skills bench's tasks: the module under test is the agent's to write
